  <item>
    <title><![CDATA[Featured Image Captions]]></title>
    <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>Each Featured Image block below has its caption turned on with the caption button in the block toolbar. The caption field is left blank, so each image shows the caption saved in the media library.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

